inputFields.description:
Invite token value. Required to register once at least one user already exists;
omitted (or ignored) for the very first registration, which self-bootstraps the
initial admin account.

types.description:
Show entity representing a TV show.

The Episodes relation is automatically generated by the GraphQLRelations macro
and uses DataLoader for N+1 prevention. Query with:
```graphql
Show {
Episodes(Page: { Limit: 10 }) {
Edges { Node { ... } }
PageInfo { TotalCount }
}
}
```
